WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.316
This query places two LAST_VALUE calculations side
by side The

00:00:06.343 --> 00:00:12.115
first uses the default ordered frame The second
explicitly extends

00:00:12.141 --> 00:00:18.028
from unbounded preceding to unbounded following Run
the query and compare

00:00:18.054 --> 00:00:23.706
the columns This example shows why frame boundaries
are part of the meaning

00:00:23.719 --> 00:00:24.798
of a window function
